# Google Search Console — HTML tag verification
# 1. Add property at https://search.google.com/search-console
# 2. Choose "URL prefix" → https://suzettesun.com
# 3. Pick "HTML tag" and copy the content= value only (not the full meta tag)
# 4. Set in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables → Production
GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
